WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.590 line:78% align:center
I'm a senior cybersecurity
consultant with EY.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.130 line:78% align:center
What do you do if you want to get into
cybersecurity or cybersecurity consulting?

00:00:09.820 --> 00:00:13.260 line:78% align:center
You can directly study cybersecurity,
information technology, thinking

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.310 line:78% align:center
involving data science is very
big in our industry.

00:00:16.580 --> 00:00:20.980 line:78% align:center
And then just in general, understanding how
computers work, how technology

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.500 line:78% align:center
interacts. There's definitely a
couple of certifications that

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:30.100 line:78% align:center
you could pursue. Like the CISSP
certification is like the big one.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:34.890 line:78% align:center
I would highly recommend Python is a great
language to learn, SQL, Excel,

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:40.780 line:78% align:center
Jira. Key soft skill for someone
who wants to be in

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.920 line:78% align:center
cybersecurity is absolutely being able to
explain something technical in

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:46.590 line:78% align:center
a very straightforward way.

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.170 line:78% align:center
I hope to see you one day working alongside
me in cybersecurity consulting.
